result: 'docs/config-blocks.md written. Config block = indentation-scoped sugar desugaring
  to ordinary Jinn record/object literals (real compilable Jinn, one eval model).
  Q3 resolved: entry = `key clause-list` in a distinct grammatical context; connectors
  are a closed schema-driven set so `opt 3` reads as a connector-clause not a call/binary-expr;
  LL(1), no backtracking, no collision with expr-statements. Three shorthands pinned.
  Schema validation per consumer. project.jn = first schema. Restriction lint over
  desugared record (no calls/control-flow/*name) → no install-time execution by construction.
  General construct, manifest wired now, general use provisional in stability.md.'
description: 'Decided grammar for a general declarative config-block construct that
